      "text": "Combine oats, almond-coconut milk, chia seeds, coconut, cardamom, cinnamon, vanilla, ginger, and nutmeg in a serving bowl until well combined. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for 8 hours to overnight.",
